2. EchoPulseNode
vendor/epn contains the original local project's analysis service dependency
subset and its required prompt asset, copied with the user's request to combine
their two projects. Copyright remains with the original author(s).
Changes: env.ts loads only Afterglow/.env; DeepSeekClient.ts adds a 45s timeout.
The local wrapper disables remote metadata lookup and exposes a narrowed API.
